OL,3,GNEWSAWant to look confident when you
OL,4,Aspeak? It's all in the eyebrows
OL,5,
OL,6,FWant to sound more confident?
OL,7,FResearchers at the University of
OL,8,FGlasgow say your audience may be paying
OL,9,Fas much attention to your eyebrows as
OL,10,Fyour words.
OL,12,FA study of facial movements found that
OL,13,Fsubtle changes around the eyes and
OL,14,Fbrows can have a significant impact on
OL,15,Fhow confident a speaker appears to
OL,16,Flisteners.
OL,18,FThe team created computer-generated
OL,19,Fspeakers and varied their facial
OL,20,Fmovements while keeping their spoken
OL,21,Fwords and vocal tone consistent.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
