OL,3,GNEWSAWant to look confident when you
OL,4,Aspeak? It's all in the eyebrows
OL,5,
OL,6,FParticipants from Western European and
OL,7,FEast Asian cultures then rated how
OL,8,Fconfident the speakers appeared. Across
OL,9,Fboth groups, raised eyebrows and a slow
OL,10,Fblink were consistently linked with
OL,11,Fgreater confidence.
